"Precarica i font custom usati come body/heading per evitare FOUT (Flash of "
"Unstyled Text)."
msgstr ""
"Preloads custom fonts used as body/heading to avoid FOUT (Flash of Unstyled "
"Text)."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:513
msgid "Video facade"
msgstr "Video facade"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:514
msgid ""
"Mostra un'anteprima statica dei video YouTube/Vimeo. L'iframe si carica solo "
"al click. Risparmia ~500KB per video."
msgstr ""
"Shows a static preview of YouTube/Vimeo videos. The iframe loads only on click. Saves ~500KB per video."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:523
msgid "fetchpriority hero image"
msgstr "fetchpriority hero image"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:524
msgid ""
"Aggiunge fetchpriority=\"high\" alla prima immagine della pagina e rimuove "
"lazy loading dagli elementi above-fold."
msgstr ""
"Adds fetchpriority=\"high\" to the first image on the page and removes lazy "
"loading from above-fold elements."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:533
msgid "Lazy loading immagini"
msgstr "Image lazy loading"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:534
msgid ""
"Aggiunge loading=\"lazy\" alle immagini below-the-fold. Riduce il peso "
"iniziale della pagina."
msgstr ""
"Adds loading=\"lazy\" to below-the-fold images. Reduces initial page weight."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:551
msgid "Domini personalizzati"
msgstr "Custom domains"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:552
msgid ""
"Aggiungi domini per dns-prefetch e preconnect personalizzati (uno per riga, "
"con https://)."
msgstr ""
"Add domains for custom dns-prefetch and preconnect (one per line, with "
"https://)."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:557
msgid "DNS Prefetch"
msgstr "DNS Prefetch"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:560
msgid "Risolve il DNS in anticipo. Utile per CDN e servizi esterni."
msgstr "Resolves DNS in advance. Useful for CDNs and external services."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:563
msgid "Preconnect"
msgstr "Preconnect"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:566
msgid ""
"Apre connessione completa (DNS + TCP + TLS). Più aggressivo del dns-"
"prefetch, usare solo per risorse critiche."
msgstr ""
"Opens a full connection (DNS + TCP + TLS). More aggressive than dns-"
"prefetch, use only for critical resources."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:586
msgid "Pulizia head"
msgstr "Head cleanup"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:587
msgid ""
"Rimuovi risorse non necessarie dal <head> per ridurre richieste e peso della "
"pagina."
msgstr ""
"Remove unnecessary resources from <head> to reduce requests and page weight."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:593
msgid "Rimuovi jQuery Migrate"
msgstr "Remove jQuery Migrate"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:594
msgid ""
"Rimuove jquery-migrate.js (~10KB). Necessario solo per compatibilità con "
"plugin molto vecchi."
msgstr ""
"Removes jquery-migrate.js (~10KB). Only needed for compatibility with very "
"old plugins."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:603
msgid "Rimuovi emoji scripts"
msgstr "Remove emoji scripts"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:604
msgid ""
